# Trial-Size Trial by Wind (outlands 197), the guard's other operands. A WAR of level 20 at Selbina-Rabao fame level 2: not
# offered (71 on both talks); accepted by GM, the WAR's trade of the fork: nothing (the SMN test of the trade), and the
# talk is 68 (the accepted arm reads no job). The level side is #level19.
char zone=Rabao pos=-13.5,7.9,-9.5 job=WAR lvl=20
fame Sandoria 38
fame Bastok 37                            # Selbina-Rabao 50
item MiniTuningForkOfWind
login
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # UseFallback 0: the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the script: not a SMN: the quest's nil; the default 71
finish
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWind accepted
trade Rahi_Fohlatti MiniTuningForkOfWind x1 # not a SMN: nothing
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the default 71
finish
trigger Rahi_Fohlatti                     # the fork held: 68
finish
